    <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-gray-400 leading-relaxed">The final dialog that was shown to 800 million Microsoft users. Have you seen it yet?</p>
  </div>
  <p>Unified Consent shipped across 5 platforms and 5 apps, reaching 800 million Microsoft consumer users — hitting the business and regulatory goal of 99% of active targetable users by the end of CY23.</p>
  <p>More than a product launch, it established a shared privacy infrastructure that eliminated data silos across Microsoft's consumer ecosystem for the first time.</p>

